      "reason": "ONLY the age-gated ESCALATION branches of sweepStalePending (hard-coded 15 / 10 / 20-minute thresholds, index.js) — no production config surface (§11.2 ruling): GAP unless real time is practical. The STRANDED (captured, not yet materialized) state and the immediate re-drive (materialized) need no elapsed age (production attempts recovery at once, index.js:2669) and are REQUIRED cells (codex r2 P1-5)."
    },
    {
      "scenario": "S11",
      "lp": "releasing",
      "reason": "the scheduled release uses default lead windows (validateScheduledFor / releaseAtFor / releaseDecision defaults) — no production config surface (§11.2): real time only if the default lead fits the suite budget, else GAP (decided in P2)"
    },
    {
      "scenario": "S11",
      "lp": "blocked",
      "reason": "slot-closed block at the scheduled sweep — same windows as releasing (§11.2): GAP unless real time is practical (decided in P2)"
    }
  ],
